<li>
<p>Take an hour or two to record yourself saying, in a weird Muppet-y voice, “Nom, nom, nom, nom” over and over. Ideally, you should put these into several tracks rather than one lengthy recording, and break up the noms with an occasional something like, 'Yum, I love dirt!&quot; Or “Oooh! Cat hair, my favorite!”</p>
